      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们一起听医生说明今后的治疗方式后，\n就离开了医院。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d78c97e23e91a074662636ad7d09fcd378ad50972266af6e3f2dd41cf1f9db0e",
