    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b8b32a3d132e07fb387ae0a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──几天后。跑完了“皋月赏”，\n东瀛佐敦预定这周末\n要去医院接受第一次治疗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4203c766a8e3c65a5c842504cfa767545f8180b9d288e58672a7026b140d46b1",
