      "uid": "zhcn:742ae6d395b0e03199cb5244",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错。因为你们，\n世人对三冠路线的热情也沸腾了起来。\n还说要寻找下个佐敦呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59f84ee81852b8c4f722c41c35959294333507dcad5179af3e543bcecd7cdc95",
