    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ca861739fdc79e98ec98711",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "辣妹赛马娘们",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2cb622ffcd1aadd6407f97235bb6a5ce99b903cdcc382d8bea26647acb66034",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23bc3aa0648c12f334c8ff0d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "佐敦！\n佐敦！佐敦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08bf54956164f1dc4070fd33a618244603f778fbd94a44d3060ee23b2f66f72b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f688bc88cbf9b2d91d7873d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在气喘吁吁的东瀛佐敦身后，\n一群陌生赛马娘直奔而来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "873853c77c02212c6da17f32678466b371e369ba5c710edc3c2af1ddb1547679",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5866eaa8b82df0df1859d9a0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "辣妹赛马娘A",
      "source_fingerprint": "b927589fe59a3893e4c9c9feec22e3c51c2c27a3719054e49c00b65dbb25bfd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05b6bf25739a81c77d7349fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没有啦，我们看到你那篇报导后！\n就好佩服你！可以跟我们说说话吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fbe4ea2c57972e550ad6f5b43e09059909d1b0fbf06fb8d3dfdf19953764abc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:734e933164b0cfb7be3a1570",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们拿出手机给我们看的，\n是一篇网络报导。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b77b33afc39077c5828a89a452b9f0c4a509914588fd5469205ec6cc3e076a0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90beb5f40e6f9ca844369d9c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“东瀛佐敦获得的荣耀。\n历经磨难后掌握的胜利。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bfbe7c4ac7d6b25bb9b06135012fe3732322b002e7e08bec57a5045e849ee7d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9a02eaec1f25d85371abf6c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这篇报导在内文中，\n还配上东瀛佐敦在“皋月赏”前练跑时，\n浑身泥泞的照片。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7a1c22db7019c56013e898dc03ce5268664c528569ecc47f18e0ea63b3f4ea1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:280469b25e35e89ed2118818",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在为治疗脚趾甲烦恼的同时，为了实现梦想\n经过反复训练后，全力跑完了“皋月赏”，\n却在演唱会前紧急送医，震惊观众──",
      "source_fingerprint": "06b6ccaa3441af6a6c95c29a4c3549f475783db619a14a9577fdc0d1a44f4311",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048305.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84fbacc6503e331d86c946ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──就医回来之后，从她的笑容\n可以看出她下了某种决心。\n今后她一定能跑出亮眼的比赛吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2200c66f56b2632155d6c4eb9553d45ac93f56c18103b88f27f9615f0673aed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1048/storytimeline_501048305.json",
      "json_path": [
